{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中共中央政治局委員、外長王毅，出席瀾湄合作外長會期間，邀請柬埔寨副首相兼外交大臣布拉索昆、以及泰國副總理兼外長西哈薩茶敘交流。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n新華社報道，三方就加強合作、維護地區穩定，包括推動柬泰建立信任措施、改善關係交流，形容是具有建設性。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:26:00.656727+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:45.711588+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:51.958002+00:00","content_hash":"dc5ad3f89ad5da58a4d2650d2000342559b80de1f051877bca4af3e970b8798c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}